      "accepted_answers": null,
      "value_tolerance": 0,
      "question_type": "mcq",
      "rationale": "Correct answer: At least two. This is directly supported by PD 1096 2004 Revised IRR, Section 1302.",
      "explanation": "Apartments ≥5 storeys → 1 elevator, 24 hrs/day. The threshold is 5 storeys (not 6, not 10). The 24-hour service requirement is non-negotiable for residential buildings where occupants cannot be expected to use stairs at all hours.",
      "code_citation": "PD 1096, Rule XIII, Sec. 1302",
