      "rationale": "Correct answer: Parts 1 and 2 of the Philippine Electrical Code adopted under RA 7920. This is directly supported by PD 1096 2004 Revised IRR, Section 1301.",
      "explanation": ">15.00 m building height → 1.80 m horizontal clearance from conductor to wall. Below 15.00 m, standard Table XIII.1 clearances apply. The 15-meter threshold corresponds roughly to a 4–5 storey building where service crane operations become more likely.",
