      "value_tolerance": 0,
      "question_type": "mcq",
      "rationale": "Correct answer: 1.80 m. This is directly supported by PD 1096 2004 Revised IRR, Section 1301.",
      "explanation": "Window clearance = 1.00 m horizontal. This is the same value as the sloped-roof clearance (1.00 m) — a potential confusion point. Context determines which applies: roof pitch → 1.00 m vertical; window → 1.00 m horizontal.",
